00:07:40.313 --> 00:07:41.544
- Yeah, without my medicine, yeah.

00:07:41.544 --> 00:07:43.951
I can't come outside two weeks.

00:07:43.951 --> 00:07:45.401
I'll give you a good example.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.220
To walk over here,

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.663
say I did not have the stuff.

00:07:53.681 --> 00:07:55.246
To walk over here, I could walk over here

00:07:55.246 --> 00:07:56.546
maybe in about 20 minutes.

00:07:57.558 --> 00:07:58.740
- [Mark] That's like three or four blocks.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.573
- Yeah.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.400
Now that I have this
stuff, to walk over here,

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.720
it takes 20 hours.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.140
It would never take twenty hours,

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.030
but I'm just giving you an example.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.417
It take a while.

00:08:08.417 --> 00:08:09.250
- [Mark] Yeah, it'd take a long time.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.917
- I'd sit here and have to stop.

00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:16.890
One time, I was by the flower shop,

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.691
where I panhandled, it was
where I first met you at.

00:08:19.691 --> 00:08:20.524
I was like, "Uh-oh."

00:08:20.524 --> 00:08:21.700
I didn't have my stuff on me.

00:08:23.397 --> 00:08:25.690
And so, I was trying to

00:08:27.352 --> 00:08:28.802
figure which would be better.

00:08:29.657 --> 00:08:32.067
To get to a place and call 911.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.543
Or go, right next to the parking lot,

00:08:36.543 --> 00:08:38.834
at the corner there,
there's the fire station.

00:08:38.834 --> 00:08:40.500
You know it's right there.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.910
I walk over there. Which will be best?

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.530
Now, I'm down where I
used to be sitting at.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.680
- [Mark] It's only two blocks.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:49.098
- And I was thinking
about going to my place,

00:08:49.098 --> 00:08:51.187
and then calling them.

00:08:51.187 --> 00:08:52.730
But I couldn't do it.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:56.580
When I got to the corner,
at the fire station,

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.497
the button you push is right there.

00:09:03.497 --> 00:09:05.152
When I got there, I had to bend over

00:09:05.152 --> 00:09:07.858
and catch my breath when I get to it.

00:09:07.858 --> 00:09:08.691
When I to it, I looked at it.

00:09:08.691 --> 00:09:09.623
I looked down and then looked at it.

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:12.370
I was so tired, I pushed it.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.040
The guys came out

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.060
and gave me a breathing tube
right outside, out there.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.227
At the fire, it's down this way, yeah.

00:09:18.227 --> 00:09:19.060
At the fire department right there.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.227
- [Mark] It's right there.

00:09:20.227 --> 00:09:21.503
- Yeah.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:26.230
- [Mark] So, Jerry, what
advice would you give

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.930
to somebody who's
struggling with depression

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:30.223
or struggling with life?

00:09:31.533 --> 00:09:33.357
Just having a hard time with life.

00:09:33.357 --> 00:09:36.730
And you seem to be so content and happy.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:37.730
- I'd just tell them

00:09:39.411 --> 00:09:41.605
put their trust in God, in Jesus.

00:09:41.605 --> 00:09:43.600
Keep their faith in Jesus.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.100
He'll provide you a way,
if you provide him a way.

00:09:48.829 --> 00:09:50.280
He'll provide they way.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.440
- [Mark] Lots of guidance there, right?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.273
- Yeah.

00:09:54.867 --> 00:09:56.183
- Like I said, don't worry
about the things in life.

00:09:57.929 --> 00:10:00.391
All you gotta do is believe in him.

00:10:00.391 --> 00:10:02.058
He'll provide a way.

00:10:05.242 --> 00:10:06.242
Like I said,

00:10:09.561 --> 00:10:10.644
take my case.

00:10:15.361 --> 00:10:16.815
Don't worry about the
things you can't change.

00:10:16.815 --> 00:10:18.602
Just accept it.

00:10:18.602 --> 00:10:20.228
That's what the Bible says.

00:10:20.228 --> 00:10:22.289
Don't worry about the
things you cannot change.

00:10:22.289 --> 00:10:25.039
Accept the things you can change.

00:10:31.635 --> 00:10:35.302
- Yeah, yeah. Life is
beautiful, Mark. Yeah.

